{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_r2734gpfe5elioaos3kddqrouo62ncun5jvbv6staioelaj5rdhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. The C library turned out to be a single-function library, and I verified that against the built `.so` rather than assuming.\n\n**Scope enumeration (definition of done)**\n- `c_src/` contains exactly 3 files: `CMakeLists.txt`, `include/driver.h`, `src/driver.c` (28 + 31 lines of source, mostly license header).\n- Built the C library with `gcc -shared -fPIC`; `nm -D --defined-only` exports exactly one public symbol: `T driver`.\n- Header declares only `void driver(const char *s1, const char *s2);` — no namespace/renaming macros, so the linker name is plain `driver`.\n\n**Translation** (`translation/`)\n- `Cargo.toml`: `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`.\n- `src/lib.rs`: `#[unsafe(no_mangle)] pub unsafe extern \"C\" fn driver(*const c_char, *const c_char)`, plus a faithful in-Rust reimplementation of `strcspn` (scans `s1`, per-char membership scan of `s2`, `s2`'s NUL excluded from the reject set, so empty `s2` ⇒ `strlen(s1)`).\n- Output is emitted via the platform's variadic `printf(\"%zu\\n\", …)` rather than Rust's `println!`, so both the formatting *and* the stdio buffering/flush behavior are identical to C (important since the C code writes through libc's `stdout` buffer).\n\n**Verification**\n- `cargo build --release` — clean, no warnings.\n- Symbol gate: `comm -23` of C exports vs Rust exports is **empty**; both `.so`s export exactly `T driver`.\n- Differential test: linked an identical harness against each `.so` and byte-compared hex dumps of stdout across 19 inputs — empty `s1`, empty `s2`, both empty, no-match, match-at-0, match-at-end, multi-char reject sets, whitespace/tab, UTF-8 multibyte, high bytes (`\\xff\\xfe\\x80`, exercising `c_char` signedness), and a 5101-byte string. All identical.\n\nNothing in `c_src/` was modified; the scratch build/test directory was removed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":26210,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":374,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e036204-2918-41af-b9ab-b2e78e3f27a0","uuid":"c4e884f0-9026-4be5-9ed3-dc42ff9a2eb8","timestamp":"2026-08-28T14:55:00.381Z"}
